{title: Apsara Aali}
{artist: Ajay Atul Bela Shende}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] Komal kaya ki moh maya Punava chandna nhale
[C] Sonyaat sazale roopyat bhijle,        [C] Ratnaprabha tanu nyaale Hi natali thatali
[C] Jashi umatali chandani rang mahaali,        [C] paahun thizli Indrasabha bhavatali
Apsara [C] aa [F] li... Indrapuri tun [C] khaali
Pasarli [C] laa [F] li... ratnaprabha tanu [C] nyali
Ti hasali [C] gaa [F] li... chandani rang ma [C] hali
Apsara [C] aa [F] li.. Punava chandana na [C] hali
Chhabi [C] dar surat dekhni janu hirkni nar gulzar
saan [Fm] gate umar kan [C] chuki bhapudi [E] mukhi,        sosate [C] bhaar
She [E] lati khunaavi kati,        tashi hanu [E] vati, nayan tal [C] war.. [C#m]
[C#m] hee rati madu [C] bharli, daji,        [C] thinagi shingarachi
[C#m] kasturi dar [C] valali daji chook hi varyachi
Hee [C] natali thatali,        [C] Jashi umatali
[C] chandani rang mahaali,        [C] paahun thizli [C] Indrasabha bhavatali
Apsara [C] aa [F] li... Indrapuri tun [C] khaali
